  "body": "Welcome to your next chapter-where timeless design, generous land, and complete freedom come together in the heart of Orewa.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a generous freehold 542sqm section in the exclusive Kauri Grove enclave, this end townhouse offers the rarest combination: elegant living, expansive private grounds, and no body corporate, giving you total control, privacy, and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nThis is a home for those ready to downsize without compromise. Whether you're a passionate gardener, need space for hobbies, or want room for visiting grandkids to explore, this property has the flexibility to fit your lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSpread over 165sqm and two thoughtfully planned levels, the interior, designed by renowned Kate O'Connor, exudes sophistication. Enjoy sun-filled, open-plan living, a modern entertainer's kitchen, three spacious double bedrooms, and indoor-outdoor flow to a large balcony and fully fenced garden sanctuary.\r\n\r\nAs a resident of Kensington Park, you'll also enjoy resort-style amenities: a heated indoor pool, gym, sauna, on-site café, and landscaped walking trails, all maintained by the Residents Association for a minimal annual fee, without being part of a body corporate.  It's a secure, low maintenance lifestyle just 450m from Orewa Beach and the village's welcoming cafes, shops and services.\r\n\r\nOnly three townhouses remain.  Move in ready now.   \r\n\r\nVisit our sales suite Tuesday to Sunday 10am to 2pm, 1 Parkside Drive, Orewa.",
